# Parameterized type alias with annotation
# Pair expects 2 type params; @[Pair Int] annotation passes through at runtime
# (type-level annotations are not enforced at runtime without a resolved type).

[Pair: [type [let a b] [Pair first: a  second: b]]]
[@[Pair Int] [Pair.Pair first: 1  second: 2]]
=== out
Variant(Pair.Pair, Dict({"first": Int(1), "second": Int(2)}))
